<!--
  The Check's stand-in for the channels' YouTube feeds (lib/music/youtubeFeedsServer.ts reads
  it when ARKPEDIA_YOUTUBE_FEED_FIXTURE names this file: check.yml's Build step and the
  Playwright webServer). One document for six of the channels in lib/music/youtubeConfig.ts,
  each entry tagged with its <yt:channelId> as a real feed's entries are, newest first; the
  reader hands each channel its own. Six a channel, as VIDEOS_PER_CHANNEL keeps, and two
  channels lead with a title the feed filter drops (Endfield; no "Arknights"), so
  /community-hub/videos has 34 cards, more than its first 24-card batch, so it grows on scroll.
  The thumbnails are inline SVG, so the cards draw their art with no network.
-->
